      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Code Generation**\n\nI'm initiating the Python file generation. Right now, my focus is on crafting `synthesize_text.py`. It'll leverage AWS Polly for synthesizing text into speech. This is the first step, and the other files will follow the successful creation of this fundamental one.\n\n\n**Constructing Initial Script**\n\nI'm now building the `synthesize_text.py` script. The core functionality centers around integrating AWS Polly. I'm focusing on synthesizing plain text into an audio byte stream using boto3, ensuring the AWS Polly client is properly instantiated for identification. This is the bedrock; further files will build on this.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789843475262,
          "start": 1789843474421
