        "text": "**Developing SSML Synthesis**\n\nI'm now focused on building `synthesize_ssml.py`, sticking with AWS Polly for SSML synthesis. The creation of this is underway, to ensure I can handle more advanced text-to-speech tasks in the future. I am aiming to use it to generate the proper SSML documents with the text provided to it.\n\n\n",
