        "text": "**Constructing Local Files**\n\nI'm now focused on building the necessary local helper files. My immediate priority is `speech_client.py`. This crucial file will manage local configurations and provide essential client utilities for Text-to-Speech, particularly for AWS Polly. It\u2019s where the local groundwork starts.\n\n\n",
