        "text": "**Defining Speech Models**\n\nI'm starting to build the foundational data structures for text-to-speech. I'm focusing on defining `speech_models.py`, which will house the local request, response, and normalization helpers. These will be simple and streamlined to handle the text-to-speech interaction.\n\n\n",
